@startuml CampusSignal_Critical_Use_Cases_Reference
' Portfolio reference revision dated 31 October 2026.
' Derived from the team RAD-v1 and supplied reference model.
' This is not the recovered original source of the submitted Figure 1.
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
actor "Campus User" as User
actor "Technician" as Tech
actor "IT Administrator" as Admin
actor "AP Controller" as AP
rectangle "CampusSignal critical use cases" {
  usecase "UC-01\nSubmit Connectivity Evidence" as UC01
  usecase "UC-02\nTriage and Assign an Issue" as UC02
  usecase "UC-03\nRecord an Intervention" as UC03
  usecase "UC-04\nVerify Service Recovery" as UC04
  usecase "UC-05\nInvestigate Underobserved Zones" as UC05
  usecase "Evaluate Submitted\nMeasurement" as Evaluate
  usecase "Create / Update\nCandidate Issue" as Candidate
  usecase "Attempt to Retrieve\nAP Controller Telemetry" as Telemetry
  UC01 ..> Evaluate : <<include>>
  Candidate ..> UC01 : <<extend>>\n[configured detection criteria met]
  UC02 ..> Telemetry : <<include>>
  UC05 ..> Telemetry : <<include>>
}
User -- UC01
Tech -- UC03
Admin -- UC02
Admin -- UC04
Admin -- UC05
AP -- Telemetry
note bottom of Candidate
  A matching issue is updated; otherwise a candidate is created.
  Utility use cases are omitted from this focused reference.
end note
note bottom of Telemetry
  Retrieval is read-only; current telemetry is not a precondition.
  Stale or unavailable telemetry is explicitly labelled.
end note
@enduml
